sequenceDiagram
    actor NOC as NOC
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant Scheduler as Scheduler
    participant DB as Database

    Note over NOC,DB: HKN-010: Menjadwalkan Backup Otomatis Perangkat

    NOC->>FE: Set jadwal backup<br/>(harian/mingguan/custom cron)
    activate FE
    FE->>BE: POST /api/schedules
    activate BE
    Note over BE: Validasi format cron<br/>dan pilih perangkat
    
    BE->>DB: Save schedule config
    activate DB
    DB-->>BE: Return schedule_id
    deactivate DB
    
    BE->>Scheduler: Register cron job
    activate Scheduler
    Note over Scheduler: Setup cron task<br/>per perangkat
    
    FE-->>NOC: Backup terjadwal aktif<br/>(next run: timestamp)
    deactivate Scheduler
    deactivate BE
    deactivate FE
